    "name":  "PACK - Aluminum Profile 2 meters Recessed - ALAS (Wings) - for LED Strips",
    "reference":  "92038-100",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIlluminate with style and versatility! Our \u003cstrong\u003eAluminum Profile for LED Strips - ALAS model - 2m,\u003c/strong\u003e stands out for its exceptional lightness and corrosion resistance. Its superior thermal conductivity ensures optimal and lasting performance. Adaptable to any style, it is perfect for architectural lighting, interiors, furniture, shops, exteriors and vehicles. Create unique atmospheres with elegance and quality!\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eRecessed Aluminum Profile 2 meters - ALAS (Wings) - for LED Strips\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRevolutionary 2-meter aluminum profile - ALAS MODEL - for LED strips. Made of PURE ALUMINUM by extrusion.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAdvantages: Lightweight, corrosion resistant, durable, excellent thermal conductivity, recyclable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe aluminum structure acts as an efficient heat sink.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eUses: Architectural lighting, indoor, furniture, commercial, outdoor, vehicle.\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFactorLED guarantees QUALITY warranty.\u003c/p\u003e",
